  "solution": "Concept Used:\n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n(4(3)/(4)-3(1)/(3))÷((3)/(4)-(3)/(5))+(3)/(5)×(5)/(7)× (7)/(9)\n\n⇒ (19/4 – 10/3) ÷ (3/4 – 3/5) + 3/5 × 5/7 × 7/9\n\n⇒ (57 – 40)/12 ÷ (3/4 – 3/5) + 3/5 × 5/7 × 7/9\n\n⇒ 17/12 ÷ (15 – 12)/20 + 3/5 × 5/7 × 7/9\n\n⇒ 17/12 ÷ 3/20 + 3/5 × 5/7 × 7/9\n\n⇒ 17/12 × 20/3 + 3/5 × 5/7 × 7/9\n\n⇒ 85/9 + 3/5 × 5/7 × 7/9\n\n⇒ 85/9 + 1/3\n\n⇒ 88/9\n\n⇒ 9(7)/(9)\n\n**∴ The required value is 9(7)/(9)**\n\ne",
